{"id": 998614, "slug": "your-mother", "name": "Your Mother", "name_original": "Your Mother", "description": "<p>Game features:</p><p>-Learn new languages: You will learn dozen of languages from your mother-in-game: Japanese, British English, American English, Cantonese, Minnan, Northeastern, Shanghainese and more.</p><p>-Discover mysterious mothers: When you open the game, there is a chance that a mysterious mother will appear, such as a Japanese Yakuza mother.</p><p>-Remote greetings with multiple players: Your mother can visit your friend’s mother and spend unforgettable time together.</p><p>-Support \"Steam Workshop\": create your favourite mother character. <br/> <br/>Instructions: <br/>-Click the character to open the menu. <br/>-The character's gaze will follow the movement of your mouse. <br/>-Supports character dragging (left mouse button) and zooming in and out (using the mouse wheel during dragging), but please do not block mother from watching TV. <br/>-You can switch the screen where the character is located in a dual-screen situation through the following operations: \"win key\" + \"shift\" + left and right keys.  <br/> <br/>Join our community to receive more love and kindness from mothers. With your support, we can continue to make more games about moms.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-02-28", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-11-23T09:32:20", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/1ec/1ec6d0897e32fd95e88eedf696383c22.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/c56/c56836fc24c249655f91961ac3a992d3.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 2, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 7, "added_by_status": {"yet": 1, "owned": 5, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 9, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 21, "parent_achievements_count": 21, "reddit_url": "", "re